		<ul id="e03116">
			<li>
				<p>Press the <term>DRIVE MODE</term> button.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p> <term>DRIVE MODE</term> will change to <term>NORMAL</term> mode when the vehicle is restarted.</p>
			</li>
			<li>Depending on the region, the vehicle switches to <term>ECO</term> mode or <term>NORMAL</term> mode upon restart.</li>
			<li>
				<p>Press the <term>GT</term> button to change to <term>GT</term> mode.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="true" outputclass="formatc" id="e03117">
			<desc>
				<p importance="default">: for GT</p>
			</desc>
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="23*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="77*"/>
				<thead>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>Mode</p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>Characteristics</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term translate="no">ECO</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Drive motor control to prevent electric economy from deteriorating</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term translate="no">NORMAL</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Typical mode of driving, used for driving on general roads, urban areas and highways.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row>
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term translate="no">SPORT</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Provides fast and dynamic driving with steering wheel and drive motor control</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term translate="no">SNOW</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Control the driven wheel’s driving force on slippery roads such as snow to enable a stable start and suppress tires from slipping.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row>
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term translate="no">MY DRIVE</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="left" valign="middle">
							<p>Drive mode selectable for each preferred component within the theme system</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
					<row>
						<entry colname="1" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p> <term>GT*</term> </p>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2" align="center" valign="middle">
							<p>Provides sportier and firm riding for maximum performance</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
	</conbody>
</concept>